I'm really enjoying this little project so I'm spending a lot of time making
fixes and whatnot.  This results in quick turn-around times.  If you're
really not interested in this script, my apologies for the spam.

In this release I've incorporated the feedback that I got from 1.0 and 1.1.

I've also added a new feature or two.  I've attached the change notes if
you're interested.

At some point here, I should think this might be beneficial to put up on
lojban.org somewhere.  Maybe I'll save that for v2.0 when I port this thing
to something that's cross-platform.

Here's the link: http://www.filedropper.com/quickdictv12

